{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09517","headline":"遇旅鹤 · 孙昌胤","name":"遇旅鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵鹤产绝境，昂昂无与俦。\n羣飞沧海曙，一叫云山秋。\n野性方自得，人寰何所求。\n时因戏祥风，偶尔来中州。\n中州帝王宅，园沼深且幽。\n希君惠稻粱，欲幷离丹丘。\n不然奋飞去，将适汗漫游。\n肯作池上鹜，年年空沈浮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙昌胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}